types.description:
Selects a single family-style. Exactly one member
must be supplied and non-null; the three forms are mutually exclusive:

- `pair` — a family name and style name together;
- `shorthand` — a single shorthand term, e.g. "solid", "notdog-duo-solid";
- `prefix` — a single prefix term, e.g. "fas", "fass".
